      "contentDir": "www",
      "contentUrl": "https://example.com/assets",
      "cpus": 2,
      "instances": 3,
      "marathon-uri": "http://master.mesos:8080",
      "maximumOverCapacity": 0.25,
      "mem": 2048,
      "minimumHealthCapacity": 0.6,
      "name": "nginx-web",
      "role": "frontend"
    }
  },
  "description": "We\u2019re scheduling an Nginx service called **nginx\u2011web** to run on nodes with the **frontend** role. The deployment will launch three instances, each reserved 2 CPU shares and 2048\u202fMB of memory. Host networking will be used (the bridge mode is disabled). Static files will be served from the local\u202f`www` directory, and any additional assets will be fetched from **https://example.com/assets**. Marathon coordination will point at **http://master.mesos:8080**. The configuration allows up to **25\u202f%** over\u2011capacity and requires a minimum health capacity of **60\u202f%** before scaling actions are taken."
